        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          104 Jisu Rui Kaziap Guay lev",
            "                           7. 10.7. 10. Ref. 6.6. 10.7.9",
            "          Doh hei F",
            "",
            "          1. Jisu rui Kaziap guay lev",
            "             Chamdaanvloumei kailangv \"kauhmei ruc khou,",
            "             Lungh ryanraa mikdui luangcna,",
            "             Nkhamhmei taektw tu 'chamc khwan e.",
            "",
            "                      Mi hei Azanc kiu the;",
            "                      Mi hei Azei kiu the;",
            "                      Tu lana neihlaana zangv 'chamc la tho.",
            "                      Apu kai guangtangh mak saanv,",
            "                      Nangniw lev Ai zangv 'chamc dat lak khe.",
            "",
            "          2. Lauziu Gaenghpouc bow kan the;",
            "             Lauziu nunc tei pak nkic ngam kan the.",
            "             Kathei laytatmei nunc tei",
            "             Lungh geihmei rui zaeng 'thaekc khang maek khe.",
            "",
            "          3. Kamei tu 'chamcmei nunc tei,",
            "             Kasu karic sw ngam the Kaipouc khang.",
            "             He Poubauhmei ruc khoutei,",
            "             Nzihmei latzan swlou mak ge."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
